,"x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":132,"b":10,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Herbert played the violin, Johnny played the bass."},{"p":132,"b":11,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Bass."},{"p":132,"b":12,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Turned around Teddy Turner on -- start on trombone."},{"p":132,"b":13,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Oh, John Lindsay --"},{"p":132,"b":14,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Oh, yeah."},{"p":132,"b":15,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Oh. Uh-huh."},{"p":132,"b":16,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Yeah. Played trombone."},{"p":132,"b":17,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"And then, recent --"},{"p":132,"b":18,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Nice little bass player."},{"p":132,"b":19,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Yes, he was a nice bass player. I was speaking to Howard Rumsey, down in Redondo Beach. And"},{"p":133,"b":0,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Howard -- Howard and I were talking about jazz bass players. And he was talking about Al Morgan."},{"p":133,"b":1,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Al Morgan?"},{"p":133,"b":2,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Who you must remember?"},{"p":133,"b":3,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Yeah."},{"p":133,"b":4,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Sure. Said Al Morgan was a very nice bass player, also."},{"p":133,"b":5,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"He was."},{"p":133,"b":6,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Played well with the bow."},{"p":133,"b":7,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Well all those -- all those Morgans was all right. All the Morgan -- the one who played saxophone, that's the last one died."},{"p":133,"b":8,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"That's Sam? [Andrew Morgan]"},{"p":133,"b":9,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Tuba. played tuba."},{"p":133,"b":10,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Yeah."},{"p":133,"b":11,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"They all out of St. John."},{"p":133,"b":12,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Yeah."},{"p":133,"b":13,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"La Place, John, Louisiana. The Playa St. Jordan, Mississippi."},{"p":133,"b":14,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Ory's home town."},{"p":133,"b":15,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"Oh, I see."},{"p":133,"b":16,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"They all out there, from there."},{"p":133,"b":17,"s":"MR. TURETSKY","x":"All right."},{"p":133,"b":18,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"Morgan (unintelligible) was a nice bass player."},{"p":133,"b":19,"s":"MR. GARLAND","x":"He liked the bow, too, like I like the bow."}]}